Oracle hooks for JA2 Stracciatella (Strategy First SFI-SCLA), ja2-node 2026-10-15. See LICENSE (SFI-SCLA).
Adds Oracle.cc to the build, runs the oracle from main() when JA2_ORACLE is set, and exports a
wrapper around the static LineOfSightTest. Applied by tools/oracle/build.sh with patch -p1.

